'''Invasion of Poultrio''' (トリニティ大降臨, ''Toriniti Dai Kōrin'', '''Toriniti Great Advent''') is a [[:Category:Advent Stages#Great Advent Stages|Great Advent Stage]] that was added in [[Version 15.2 Update|Version 15.2]] and appears on the '''1st''', '''2nd''', '''15th''' and '''16th''' days of every month. It is unlocked after clearing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3. The first three stages yield nothing when completed, while the final stage drops the unit [[Paperboy Cat (Rare Cat)|Paperboy Cat]].

